  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Incorrect unit conversion: assay_batch B values are stated to be in µg/L, which is equivalent to ng/mL (1 µg/L = 1 ng/mL). The analyst divided these values by 10, applying an unjustified conversion factor, so the reported mean (40.18 ng/mL) is not the true mean for the intended units.",
    "The analyst did not verify the premise about assay_batch B units; applying a wrong conversion violates the contract's premise verification requirement."
